Welcome, and thank you for stopping by. Kagasoff Law Firm is a small, attorney-led practice in Westminster, serving clients across Orange County. The same questions come up again and again, so we are starting this blog to answer them in plain English.

## What you can expect here

Our articles will focus on the areas where we help people most:

- Personal injury and what to do after an accident
- Criminal defense and your rights during an investigation
- Professional license defense
- Restraining orders
- Employment disputes
- Real estate matters

We will keep things practical and free of legal jargon. If a topic is on your mind, tell us. It may become the next post.

Every matter is different, so please treat what you read here as a starting point, not a substitute for talking with an attorney about your own situation.
